   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)><ac(3)>アフリカ大陸で、#c[BE5050]ジオン軍残党#cの行動が<im(1)>\n活発化しているとの情報が入った。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)><ac(3)>Word has arrived that #c[BE5050]Zeon remnant#c\nactivity in Africa has intensified.<im(1)>",
   "notes": "Captain Sinapus."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63003#7",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(2)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>おそらくこの動きは、アフリカに向かった<im(2)>\n#c[BE5050]ガトー#cらの作戦の一環だと思われる。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>This movement is likely part of the plan<im(2)>\nby #c[BE5050]Gato#c and his men in Africa.",
   "notes": "Captain Sinapus."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63003#8",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[5E8FD8]",
    "#c",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c",
    "<im(9)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>近辺の#c[5E8FD8]ＵＣＥ#c基地が、#c[BE5050]ギガノス#cの襲撃を<im(9)>\n何度も受けているとの情報からも、\nそれは間違いないだろう。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>Nearby #c[5E8FD8]UCE#c bases have suffered repeated\nattacks by #c[BE5050]Giganos#c, leaving no doubt.<im(9)>",
   "notes": "Captain Sinapus."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63003#9",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c",
    "<im(6)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c",
    "<im(14)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>#c[BE5050]ジオン残党#cの<im(6)>活動拠点はまだ特定されては\nいないのだが、#c[BE5050]ガトー#cと<im(14)>#c[BE5050]ガンダム２号機#c…\n彼らの目的はそこに違いない。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>The #c[BE5050]Zeon remnants#c' active base has yet<im(6)>\nto be found, but #c[BE5050]Gato#c<im(14)> and #c[BE5050]Gundam Unit 2#c...\nthat is surely their destination.",
   "notes": "Captain Sinapus."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63003#10",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[F07141]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>彼らはここで何かを起こすはずだ…\n必ず、#c[F07141]２号機を奪還#cする。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>They must be planning something here...\nWe will #c[F07141]recapture Unit 2#c without fail.",
   "notes": "Captain Sinapus."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63003#11",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 38,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(38,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<of(1)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>今回はかなり厳しい戦いになるだろうが、<of(1)>\n本艦の損傷はできるだけ抑えないとならん。\n頼んだぞ。",
   "en": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>This will be a tough fight,<of(1)> but we must\nkeep damage to this ship to a minimum.\nWe're counting on you.",
   "notes": "Captain South Burning."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63043#0",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 1,
   "tokens": [],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 1,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "アルビオンの損傷",
   "en": "Albion Damage",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63043#2",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 1,
   "portrait": 38,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(38,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(1)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>この忙しい時に、やっかいな連中が現れた。<im(1)>\n#c[BE5050]木星蜥蜴#cどもだ。",
   "en": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>Troublesome foes appeared at a bad time.<im(1)>\nIt's those #c[BE5050]Jovian Lizards#c.",
   "notes": "Captain Burning."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63043#3",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 1,
   "portrait": 38,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(38,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c",
    "<tr(1)>",
    "<im(7)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>本艦の進路上に、連中が使っている\n#c[BE5050]チューリップ#cとかいう兵器<tr(1)>が\n展開している。<im(7)>",
   "en": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>Right in our ship's path, they've deployed\na weapon called a #c[BE5050]Chulip#c.<tr(1)><im(7)>",
   "notes": "Captain Burning."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63043#4",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 1,
   "portrait": 38,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(38,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>知ってのとおり、こいつは放っておくと\n小型機動兵器を次々と吐き出す\n面倒な奴だ。",
   "en": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>As you know, if we leave it alone, it'll\nkeep spitting out small mobile weapons.\nIt's a real nuisance.",
   "notes": "Captain Burning."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63043#5",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 1,
   "portrait": 38,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(38,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[F07141]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>本艦は遠回りしている暇はない。\n至急出撃して、#c[F07141]こいつらを片付ける#cんだ。\n",
   "en": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>We don't have time to take a detour.\nSortie immediately and #c[F07141]take them out#c.\n",
   "notes": "Captain Burning. Preserved trailing newline as in source."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63043#6",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 1,
   "portrait": 38,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(38,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>時間がないので、待てるのは少しだけだ。\nすぐに前進を再開する。本艦の被害を\n抑えるため、少しでも多く破壊してくれ。",
   "en": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>We're short on time and can't wait long.\nWe'll advance soon. Destroy as many as\nyou can to keep damage to our ship down.",
   "notes": "Captain Burning."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63044#2",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 2,
   "portrait": 46,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(46,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c",
    "<im(1)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(46,1)><sp(2)>この先に#c[BE5050]ガンダム２号機#cを確認した。\n攻撃<im(1)>を仕掛けるなら今がチャンスだが、\n#c[BE5050]ギガノス#cも出てきているようだ。",
   "en": "<op(46,1)><sp(2)>#c[BE5050]Gundam Unit 2#c was spotted up ahead.\nNow is our chance to attack,<im(1)> but\n#c[BE5050]Giganos#c has appeared as well.",
   "notes": "Amuro Ray."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63044#3",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 2,
   "portrait": 46,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(46,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(2)>",
    "<im(8)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c",
    "#c[5E8FD8]",
    "#c",
    "<tr(1)>",
    "<im(9)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(46,1)><sp(2)><im(2)><im(8)>#c[BE5050]ギガノス#cは#c[5E8FD8]アルビオン#cを狙ってきている。\n時間稼ぎのようにも思えるが…<tr(1)><im(9)>\nまずはこいつらを何とかしないと。",
   "en": "<op(46,1)><sp(2)><im(2)><im(8)>#c[BE5050]Giganos#c is targeting the #c[5E8FD8]Albion#c.\nIt feels like they're stalling...<tr(1)><im(9)>\nFirst we must deal with them.",
   "notes": "Amuro Ray."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63044#4",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 2,
   "portrait": 46,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(46,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[5E8FD8]",
    "#c",
    "<of(1)>",
    "#c[F07141]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(46,1)><sp(2)>奴らを#c[5E8FD8]アルビオン#cに<of(1)>近づけさせないよう、\n#c[F07141]周辺に散開して迎撃#cするんだ。",
   "en": "<op(46,1)><sp(2)>Don't let them near the #c[5E8FD8]Albion#c.<of(1)>\n#c[F07141]Disperse around the ship to intercept#c.",
   "notes": "Amuro Ray."
  },
